# [[ .Name ]]

The [[ .Name ]] API, `/apis/[[ .Group ]]/v1`, built on
[infrapi/lib](https://github.com/infrapi/lib): its contract,
[api/[[ .Name ]]-v1.yaml](api/[[ .Name ]]-v1.yaml), checked on every request,
each one authenticated and authorized by [Kayra](https://infrapi.github.io/products/kayra/).

## Layout

```text
api/[[ .Name ]]-v1.yaml          the contract: edit it, then infrapi-cli app generate
api/zz_generated.go       generated: its schemas as Go types, Group, Roots, Contracts
cmd/[[ .Name ]]/main.go          the server
internal/config/          the settings, INFRAPI_APP_* and [[ .EnvPrefix ]]_*
internal/[[ .Name ]]/            the implementation: Service, one file per resource
internal/[[ .Name ]]/zz_generated.go  generated: Handlers, Register
dev.yaml                  the dev stack's settings (infrapi-cli dev)
.goreleaser.yaml          the release: archives, packages, image
```

## Develop

With [infrapi-cli](https://infrapi.github.io/products/cli/docs/getting-started/#1-install),
Go and podman or docker:

```bash
infrapi-cli dev init          # the dev stack, in .infrapi-dev/, from dev.yaml
infrapi-cli dev up            # Kayra, etcd and APISIX
infrapi-cli dev contexts      # dev-admin and dev-<user> contexts

infrapi-cli app add vm        # a resource: its paths and schema, internal/[[ .Name ]]/vms.go
$EDITOR api/[[ .Name ]]-v1.yaml      # its fields
infrapi-cli app generate      # the Go code from the contract
infrapi-cli app run           # the API, on :8080, with .infrapi-dev/app.env
infrapi-cli app register      # registered in Kayra, routed by the gateway
```

A resource's operations answer 501 Not Implemented until written: see
[Develop an API](https://infrapi.github.io/products/cli/docs/develop/develop-an-api/).

`make help` lists the targets: `generate`, `fmt`, `lint`, `test`, `build`,
`run`, `snapshot`.

